From d5e16ef7d876c736153b3f050bceec8f7e48145e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saverio Moscardini <4923627+savemosca@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:38:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Android handheld tuning: full-screen sharp scaling, audio
 knobs, big-core pinning

- Mobile layout fills the display when the touch pad is hidden instead of
  always reserving side rails (1080p handhelds: 4x -> 6.75x).
- The touch pad starts hidden when a physical controller is present and the
  player has not saved a choice.
- The sharp scaler (integer prescale + linear finish) now also runs on
  Android; the copy is shared with the desktop explicit-destination path.
- GBARECOMP_AUDIO_SAMPLES / _TARGET_MS / _PREROLL_MS override the audio
  callback size and bridge cushion; defaults are unchanged. The chosen
  values are logged.
- GBARECOMP_BIG_CORES=1 pins the Android game thread to the performance
  cluster, derived from cpufreq.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
